Route tenant preference reads through TenantPreferenceStore. That convention is repository-specific and should appear as an unmapped operational candidate until a custom rule is added.

## Additional review rules

Preserve public APIs unless migration work is requested. Document breaking changes and update docs when behavior changes. Preserve accessibility behavior in UI packages. Verify the build when package exports or generated clients change.

Cursor may surface these rules in a compact editor context, so the wording is intentionally direct. Surrounding prose explains why the rules exist, but the operational units are the commands, safety constraints, workflow steps, and reporting expectations.
